gpu-switcher (0.1.0-22) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial public release: GUI to switch the primary display adapter
    (GNOME/Mutter). Polkit-gated Apply / Reset to auto via a root
    D-Bus-activated helper, Reboot / Log out activation, GPU detection
    (running and configured primary), verification hint, en/ru i18n.
  * Packaging: Debian copyright and changelog files, postrm that leaves
    the managed udev rule and its backups in place on removal.

